{"id":"zakyco4kuz6gjuaa3ae8llyfo","title":"夏威夷基础设施面临海平面上升临界点威胁","originalTitle":"Oʻahu infrastructure threatened by tipping point in sea-level rise impacts","summary":"夏威夷大学马诺亚分校的研究团队发现，传统海平面上升模型低估了海岸基础设施的威胁。通过结合洪水、侵蚀和高波事件模型，研究更新了奥阿胡岛的脆弱性估计，指出在临界点时受影响的建筑和居民数量将大幅增加。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-oahu-infrastructure-threatened-sea-impacts.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T14:00:07.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-13T14:11:33.401Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-13T14:11:33.401Z","category":null,"tags":["研究成果"],"score":75,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"3280ddca-509e-4b70-8b63-f42f8c6f45f4","title":"夏威夷奥胡岛基础设施面临海平面上升威胁"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"3280ddca-509e-4b70-8b63-f42f8c6f45f4","title":"夏威夷奥胡岛基础设施面临海平面上升威胁"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fFMwU8qLXn0I","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}